     minal in /eettcc/ttttyyss is disabled, iinniitt spawns a shell on
     /ddeevv/ccoonnssoollee, with prompt # (or (rroo)# while root is still
     read-only).  When that shell exits (typically because the
     operator typed an end-of-file), and root is writable by


