NNOOTTEESS
     The writability of the root file system is probed directly
     by attempting to create /eettcc/bboooottttiimmee, and a dirty root is
     repaired and remounted in place; the system is never
     rebooted for a repair.  While root remains read-only -
     automatic repair failed - iinniitt refuses to run /eettcc/rrcc and
     stays in the single-user emergency shell.
